Package: datara
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: waters1ze <https://github.com/waters1ze/datara>
Description: High-performance Datara programming language and Forgen compiler toolchain
 Datara provides a multi-tiered compilation and execution ladder designed
 to eliminate all friction throughout the software development lifecycle.
 Includes Cranelift JIT, LLVM AOT, DPM package manager, and stdlib.
